{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Sun comes up on the [G]old dirt road
[Bm]Coffee's warm and the [A]wind is slow
[D]Every mile is a [G]song I know
[Em]Carry me [A]home
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
